{"title":"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 17","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In the base ten number system the number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/1/a9103c550961a8645c8247bbc2f21c6b0534a989.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$526$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/0/180a64879bbdfdb29665ca11220a39f827edd619.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 \\times 10^2+2 \\times 10 + 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"159\" height=\"16\" />. \nIn the Land of Mathesis, however, numbers are written in the base <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />. \nJones purchases an automobile there for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/b/b7bac8d158ad07b42ad9889011a7e4e67851a82d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$440$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> monetary units (abbreviated m.u). \nHe gives the salesman a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/e/6ee927e1332358c96c62c277441c907c4f51057f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> m.u bill, and receives, in change, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/a/eea83521b9e585be335f2a1db9eafb6e4cfe19b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$340$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> m.u. The base <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/a/eea60fb0b0ebefd9b4eb36779f3457417b3f470d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 2\\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 5\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 7\\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 8\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"357\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If Jones received <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/a/eea83521b9e585be335f2a1db9eafb6e4cfe19b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$340$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> m.u. change after paying <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/e/6ee927e1332358c96c62c277441c907c4f51057f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> m.u. for something that costs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/b/b7bac8d158ad07b42ad9889011a7e4e67851a82d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$440$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> m.u., then\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/f/4df5b1111432e6e95a87f4d3d0e4289b2751c1b8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[440_r + 340_r = 1000_r\\]\" width=\"157\" height=\"15\" />\nThis equation can be rewritten as\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/2/d82882a6bd510edcb89518a8f2b05e75e4c29d5e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[4r^2 + 4r + 3r^2 + 4r = r^3\\]\" width=\"191\" height=\"16\" />\nBring all of the terms to one side to get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/d/85d30241c6079c99727ebd3e414a6b5a642cd3b5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[r^3 - 7r^2 - 8r = 0\\]\" width=\"136\" height=\"15\" />\nFactor to get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/8/268887f0643bd927d9f39fde94f27c390d170a90.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[r(r-8)(r+1)=0\\]\" width=\"149\" height=\"18\" />\nSince <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Base_numbers\" title=\"Base numbers\">base numbers</a> are always positive, base <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, which is answer choice <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/3/693c4044f8526a8179956e8ac7a3f2f9d61e2c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"43\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><i>By Ajeet Dubey | <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://ioqm.in\">ioqm.in</a></i>\n</p><p>Let the base be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />. Converting the two numbers to base ten gives\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/9/ef966e5af0b9f38219980a756640d9a9efea1ef9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$440_r=4r^2+4r, \\qquad 340_r=3r^2+4r,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"294\" height=\"20\" />\nand\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/4/2245130cc402164de4d0e08fa917fe22e9bd2482.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1000_r=r^3.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"91\" height=\"20\" />\nTherefore\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/6/4d61f6646d06529fc4388eb6fcc4bb17fdb17043.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7r^2+8r=r^3.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"113\" height=\"18\" />\nSince <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/3/8b3a2616732fe5edb81142978f78b16652df7035.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"41\" height=\"13\" />, divide by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/7/be7087b93f83048e5a0bd50e342d00bffc3840db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r^2-7r-8=0=(r-8)(r+1).$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"260\" height=\"21\" />\nA base must be positive, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/c/95cf9ceff4c7fa25fc13adc3a520250ddfd25525.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r=8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Thus the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/3/693c4044f8526a8179956e8ac7a3f2f9d61e2c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"43\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME\" title=\"1961 AHSME\">1961 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1961 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1961\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">Problem 16</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">Problem 18</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Proble